.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-modules-metrics 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-modules\-metrics \- Print every module\-graph metric of a source root as one record line
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten modules metrics\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-root\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print every module\-graph metric of a source root as one record line
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<root>\fR
The crate\*(Aqs source root, the directory holding lib.rs
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
